---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Work With Me | Dining Unhinged"
  description="Interested in partnering with Dining Unhinged? Learn about hosted visits, sponsored campaigns, photography, and editorial standards."
>

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">

    <h1>Work With Me</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Great food deserves an audience. If you've built something worth talking
      about, I'd love to hear from you.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="policy">

  <article>

    <h2>What is Dining Unhinged?</h2>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged is an independent food and drink publication dedicated to
      discovering exceptional restaurants, breweries, wineries, distilleries,
      cafés, cocktail bars, and hospitality experiences.
    </p>

    <p>
      Every review combines original photography, thoughtful storytelling, honest
      opinions, and just enough deadpan humour to keep things interesting.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Ways We Can Work Together</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Restaurant Reviews</li>
      <li>Brewery & Distillery Features</li>
      <li>Cocktail & Drink Coverage</li>
      <li>Hotel Dining Experiences</li>
      <li>Tourism & Destination Campaigns</li>
      <li>Media Invitations</li>
      <li>Grand Openings & Special Events</li>
      <li>Sponsored Travel</li>
      <li>Professional Food Photography</li>
    </ul>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Editorial Integrity</h2>

    <p>
      Dining Unhinged accepts hosted visits and sponsored partnerships.
    </p>

    <p>
      If someone picks up the bill, readers will know.
    </p>

    <blockquote>
      The bill can be covered. The opinion can't.
    </blockquote>

    <p>
      Every hosted visit or sponsored partnership is clearly disclosed.
      Ratings, rankings, and editorial opinions remain completely independent.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Photography</h2>

    <p>
      Every feature includes original photography captured during the visit.
    </p>

    <p>
      Photography licensing for editorial and commercial use is available upon
      request.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Who Should Reach Out?</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Restaurants</li>
      <li>Breweries</li>
      <li>Wineries</li>
      <li>Distilleries</li>
      <li>Cafés</li>
      <li>Hotels & Resorts</li>
      <li>Tourism Organizations</li>
      <li>PR & Marketing Agencies</li>
      <li>Food & Beverage Brands</li>
    </ul>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <h3>Do hosted visits guarantee a positive review?</h3>

    <p>
      No. Hosted visits guarantee exactly one thing: an honest review. Every
      opinion published by Dining Unhinged reflects my genuine experience during
      the visit.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Can we pay for a review or rating?</h3>

    <p>
      No. Dining Unhinged does not sell ratings, rankings, awards, or editorial
      opinions. If a partnership exists, it will always be clearly disclosed.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Can we invite Dining Unhinged to visit?</h3>

    <p>
      Absolutely. Invitations are always welcome. Every invitation is appreciated,
      but accepting one does not guarantee coverage. Coverage does not guarantee
      praise.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Do you cover media events and grand openings?</h3>

    <p>
      Yes. Dining Unhinged is happy to consider media events, grand openings,
      tasting menus, brewery launches, destination campaigns, and other
      hospitality experiences that fit the publication.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Can we review an article before it's published?</h3>

    <p>
      No. Editorial content is never submitted for approval before publication.
      If a factual error is found, such as a menu item, address, or business
      detail, it will be corrected promptly.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Do you license your photography?</h3>

    <p>
      Yes. Original photography may be licensed for commercial or editorial use
      upon request.
    </p>

  </article>

  <article>

    <h2>Let's Talk</h2>

    <p>
      Whether you're opening a new restaurant, launching a seasonal menu,
      showcasing a destination, hosting a media event, or introducing an
      exceptional cocktail program, I'd love to hear about it.
    </p>

    <p>
      Great hospitality deserves to be discovered. If you've created something
      worth talking about, let's start the conversation.
    </p>

    <p>
  Reach out through the <a href="/contact"><strong>Contact</strong></a> page, or email me directly at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:diningunhinged@gmail.com"><strong>diningunhinged@gmail.com</strong></a>.
</p>

  </article>

</section>

</MainLayout>